# --- Source photography for the POI import ---
# 82 MB of full-size originals. `frontend/scripts/import_place_photos.py` turns
# these into the ~5.6 MB of 640px web assets under frontend/public/places/,
# which ARE committed. Keep the originals locally so the import can be re-run at
# a different size; there is no reason for them to be in the repo.
